WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:03.255
打开 Rules / Open Rules

2
00:00:03.255 --> 00:00:06.253
创建 Guide operations / Create Guide operations

3
00:00:06.253 --> 00:00:09.563
限制 Host 与 Path / Restrict Host and Path

4
00:00:09.563 --> 00:00:12.403
填写 x-guide-list / Enter x-guide-list

5
00:00:12.403 --> 00:00:15.714
选择 append / Choose append

6
00:00:15.714 --> 00:00:18.554
启用规则 / Enable the Rule

7
00:00:18.554 --> 00:00:21.453
Apply append / Apply append

8
00:00:21.453 --> 00:00:24.303
核对保留 one 并追加 two / Verify one is retained and two appended

9
00:00:24.303 --> 00:00:27.554
选择 remove / Choose remove

10
00:00:27.554 --> 00:00:30.454
Apply remove / Apply remove

11
00:00:30.454 --> 00:00:33.254
核对Header已移除 / Verify the Header was removed

12
00:00:33.254 --> 00:00:36.503
改为 Query 动作 / Switch to a Query action

13
00:00:36.503 --> 00:00:39.453
