14
00:00:39.453 --> 00:00:42.353
Apply Query remove / Apply Query removal

15
00:00:42.353 --> 00:00:45.154
核对参数被移除 / Verify the parameter is removed

16
00:00:45.154 --> 00:00:49.004
改为请求 Body 动作 / Switch to request Body replacement

17
00:00:49.004 --> 00:00:51.853
填写 request-edited / Enter request-edited

18
00:00:51.853 --> 00:00:54.809
Apply 请求正文 / Apply request-body replacement

19
00:00:54.809 --> 00:00:57.610
核对源站收到完整替换 / Verify the complete replacement at the origin

20
00:00:57.610 --> 00:01:00.655
重命名为 Guide operations done / Rename the Rule

21
00:01:00.655 --> 00:01:03.503
按名称搜索 / Search by name

22
00:01:03.503 --> 00:01:06.403
保留但停用演示规则 / Retain and disable the demo Rule

23
00:01:06.403 --> 00:01:09.304
Apply 停用状态 / Apply the disabled state
